 del sapo para obtener el mayor puntaje posible dentro del tablero, tal como en el juego original.\n\nEl juego recrea diferentes variaciones locales de Sapo/Rana de varios pa\u00edses (Colombia, Ecuador, Per\u00fa, Chile, Bolivia, Argentina y Espa\u00f1a), utilizando controles inmersivos de realidad virtual y f\u00edsicas realistas.\n\nEs un juego casual, muy intuitivo y f\u00e1cil de aprender, pero muy desafiante. Perfecto para sesiones cortas y entretenidas.", "short_description": "Juego tradicional latinoamericano de Sapo/Rana, recreado en realidad virtual."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logoA.png", "id": "9839896699447905", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830599_9839896702781238_613105640565704282_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q0yXIjALzN8Q7kNvwHdOw6b&_nc_oc=AdkVAF-COjx4Lne5IrN7zxkVwEv7D75dcPkSdHnGWlpWZZ7u5WHB2ZI0VK8uHBuh058&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyZVXNNzBHNlctggnWqP137OX7PbzleFN7F6rK0XqPU-Q&oe=69BD5A5F"}, {"file_name": "heroBannerA.png", "id": "1794159114515101", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1794159117848434_2751359420875154132_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vO4wb8f-XOYQ7kNvwEEBns-&_nc_oc=Adk6om41GIOjjT_vnxR4idGYw6hNwlZT-epcgBrId1ccZV1WJrKWN_nKT1zkhPNWMxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzWs1SSE62viOIaui5lqdKTQspvD0aYuaK8o0XL3M8oHg&oe=69BD4F97"}, {"file_name": "coverPortraitA.png", "id": "1408748950397799", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827286_1408748953731132_5797070038261668932_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1975R_YlbQQ7kNvwFV4AHz&_nc_oc=AdlI6nu2oH0i2YtQUWb6aLVlaNHmr4DOiEUVMZC1QnCtn7KEiwFVzdmne-m5V3y1fG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzl8A-7j4JDB6xytzISQhj22WDbGn1QAGfkzzXSDyaGRg&oe=6